# 基础词 Unit13
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit13核心词汇

{{countryside}}{/ˈkʌntrisaɪd/}{{n. 农村；乡下}}{{The countryside is peaceful and beautiful in spring.}}
{{county}}{/ˈkaʊnti/}{{n. 县；郡}}{{The county government organized a community fair.}}
{{couple}}{/ˈkʌpl/}{{n. 一对；夫妇；几个}}{{The couple celebrated their 25th wedding anniversary.}}
{{courage}}{/ˈkʌrɪdʒ/}}n. 勇气；胆量}}{{It takes courage to stand up for what is right.}}
{{course}}{/kɔːrs/}}n. 课程；过程；航线}}{{She enrolled in a computer science course.}}
{{court}}{/kɔːrt/}}n. 法院；球场；宫廷}}{{The case will be heard in court next month.}}
{{cousin}}{/ˈkʌzn/}}n. 堂兄弟；表姐妹}}{{My cousin lives in Canada and visits us every summer.}}
{{cover}}{/ˈkʌvər/}}v. 覆盖；报道；n. 封面}}{{Snow covered the entire landscape.}}
{{crash}}{/kræʃ/}}v. 碰撞；坠毁；n. 碰撞}}{{The plane crashed into the mountain during the storm.}}
{{crazy}}{/ˈkreɪzi/}}adj. 疯狂的；狂热的}}{{It's crazy how fast time flies.}}
{{cream}}{/kriːm/}}n. 奶油；乳霜}}{{She put cream in her coffee every morning.}}
{{create}}{/kriˈeɪt/}}v. 创造；创建}}{{The artist created a beautiful painting for the exhibition.}}
{{creature}}{/ˈkriːtʃər/}}n. 生物；动物}}{{The ocean is home to many strange creatures.}}
{{credit}}{/ˈkredɪt/}}n. 信用；学分；v. 归功于}}{{She received credit for her excellent research work.}}
{{crew}}{/kruː/}}n. 全体船员；工作人员}}{{The film crew worked tirelessly to finish the movie.}}
{{crime}}{/kraɪm/}}n. 犯罪；罪行}}{{The crime rate in the city has decreased this year.}}
{{criminal}}{/ˈkrɪmɪnl/}}adj. 犯罪的；n. 罪犯}}{{The criminal was sentenced to ten years in prison.}}
{{crisis}}{/ˈkraɪsɪs/}}n. 危机；紧要关头}}{{The economic crisis affected millions of people worldwide.}}
{{critic}}{/ˈkrɪtɪk/}}n. 批评家；评论家}}{{The film critic gave the movie a positive review.}}
{{critical}}{/ˈkrɪtɪkl/}}adj. 批评的；关键的；危急的}}{{Critical thinking is an essential skill for students.}}
{{criticism}}{/ˈkrɪtɪsɪzəm/}}n. 批评；评论}}{{His work received both praise and criticism.}}
{{crop}}{/krɒp/}}n. 庄稼；农作物；v. 收割}}{{The farmers harvested the crops in autumn.}}
{{cross}}{/krɒs/}}v. 穿过；n. 十字；交叉}}{{Look both ways before you cross the street.}}
{{crowd}}{/kraʊd/}}n. 人群；v. 拥挤}}{{A large crowd gathered in the square for the celebration.}}
{{crucial}}{/ˈkruːʃl/}}adj. 至关重要的；决定性的}}{{This is a crucial moment in the company's history.}}
{{cruel}}{/ˈkruːəl/}}adj. 残忍的；残酷的}}{{It is cruel to keep animals in small cages.}}
{{crush}}{/krʌʃ/}}v. 压碎；镇压；n. 迷恋}}{{The machine can crush rocks into small pieces.}}
{{cry}}{/kraɪ/}}v. 哭；叫喊；n. 哭声}}{{The baby cried loudly in the middle of the night.}}
{{cultural}}{/ˈkʌltʃərəl/}}adj. 文化的}}{{The city is known for its rich cultural heritage.}}
{{culture}}{/ˈkʌltʃər/}}n. 文化；修养}}{{Every country has its own unique culture.}}
{{cup}}{/kʌp/}}n. 杯子；奖杯}}{{She won the gold cup in the tennis tournament.}}
{{cure}}{/kjʊər/}}n. 治愈；疗法；v. 治愈}}{{Scientists are working to find a cure for the disease.}}
{{curious}}{/ˈkjʊəriəs/}}adj. 好奇的；奇怪的}}{{Children are naturally curious about the world around them.}}
{{currency}}{/ˈkʌrənsi/}}n. 货币；通用}}{{The local currency has lost value against the dollar.}}
{{current}}{/ˈkʌrənt/}}adj. 当前的；n. 水流；电流}}{{The current situation requires immediate action.}}
{{curriculum}}{/kəˈrɪkjələm/}}n. 课程；课程表}}{{The school revised its curriculum to include more science classes.}}
{{curve}}{/kɜːrv/}}n. 曲线；弯道；v. 弯曲}}{{The road curves sharply around the mountain.}}
{{customer}}{/ˈkʌstəmər/}}n. 顾客；客户}}{{Customer satisfaction is our top priority.}}
{{custom}}{/ˈkʌstəm/}}n. 风俗；习惯；adj. 定制的}}{{It is a custom to eat dumplings on New Year's Eve.}}
{{cut}}{/kʌt/}}v. 切；削减；n. 伤口}}{{She cut the cake into eight equal pieces.}}
